## 4. Modifications

The Buyer may modify the Software only for the permitted internal use described in this agreement. Modifications do not grant the Buyer ownership of the Copyright Owner's pre-existing code or permission to resell or distribute that code.

## 5. Breach and Remedies

Unauthorized copying, distribution, sublicensing, or resale may constitute a breach of this agreement and, where applicable, copyright infringement. The Copyright Owner may pursue remedies available under applicable law, subject to proof, legal requirements, and any applicable dispute-resolution provisions.

